<div class="contact-page"><section class="container contact-hero"><div><span class="eyebrow">There is always room for a conversation</span><h1>Come, tell us<br><em>what’s cooking.</em></h1><p>A question about your order, a recipe to share, or just a hello. We would love to hear from you.</p><span class="contact-granny-line">“First, sit down. Then tell me everything.”</span></div><span class="art-wash contact-hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'contact-kitchen.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="600" height="330"></span></section><section class="container contact-layout"><aside class="contact-details"><span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h2>A little hello<br>goes a long way.</h2><p class="contact-response">We typically respond within 24 hours on business days.</p><dl class="contact-addresses"><div><dt><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3H9L11 8L8 10Q10 15 15 17L17 14L22 16V20Q22 23 18 22Q4 19 2 7Q1 3 5 3Z"/></svg><span>Give us a call</span></dt><dd><a href="tel:+919347815723">+91 93478 15723</a></dd></div><div><dt><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M3 6L12 13L21 6"/></svg><span>Write to us</span></dt><dd><a href="mailto:contact@ammammas.in">contact@ammammas.in</a></dd></div><div><dt><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 10C19 16 12 22 12 22S5 16 5 10A7 7 0 1 1 19 10Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2"/></svg><span>Our home</span></dt><dd>Hyderabad, Telangana, India</dd></div><div><dt><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 6V12L16 15"/></svg><span>Kitchen hours</span></dt><dd>Monday–Saturday<br>9 AM–6 PM IST</dd></div></dl><div class="contact-small-art art-wash" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ 'tiffin.svg' | asset_url }}" alt=""></div></aside><section class="contact-form-card" aria-labelledby="ContactFormHeading"><span class="eyebrow">Leave us a note</span><h2 id="ContactFormHeading">What’s on your mind?</h2><p>Tell us a little about how we can help.</p>{% form 'contact', class: 'contact-note-form' %}{{ form.errors | default_errors }}{% if form.posted_successfully? %}<p class="contact-success" role="status">Thank you for your note. We will be in touch.</p>{% endif %}<div class="contact-field-row"><div class="contact-field"><label for="ContactName">Your name <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ContactName" name="contact[name]" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your full name" required></div><div class="contact-field"><label for="ContactEmail">Email address <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ContactEmail" name="contact[email]" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required></div></div><div class="contact-field"><label for="ContactSubject">Subject <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><input id="ContactSubject" name="contact[subject]" placeholder="How can we help?" required></div><div class="contact-field"><label for="ContactBody">Your message <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label><textarea id="ContactBody" name="contact[body]" rows="6" placeholder="Tell us more. If it is about an order, please include your order number." required></textarea></div><div class="contact-send-row"><button class="button" type="submit">Send your note <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><small>* Required fields</small></div>{% endform %}</section></section><div class="container contact-ending"><span></span><p>A familiar voice. A little help. A whole lot of care.</p><span></span></div></div>
{% schema %}
{"name": "Contact us", "settings": []}
{% endschema %}